#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Internal settings page for the label proxy.

Edits /etc/labelproxy.conf, shows what the last few jobs actually cropped, and
can re-run detection with the current settings without printing anything.

    labelui [--port N] [--allow CIDR,CIDR] [--conf PATH] [--backend PATH]

Stdlib only, plus the PyMuPDF already present for the backend. Deliberately
small: no framework, no database, no JS build, no mDNS advertisement.

Nothing here can consume a label. There is no print path at all.
"""
